{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Boulders and Watch Them Fall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Catacombs of Portsmoor is a dangerous place to visit, filled with falling boulders, deadly miasma, ravenous plants,\u00a0and many other environmental hazards. Do you have what is takes to learn how to survive, and solve the deadly puzzles that await you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/2e99d9efb6151717659b94d197449253.poster.avif?t=1774033205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/2e99d9efb6151717659b94d197449253.webm?t=1774033205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/2e99d9efb6151717659b94d197449253.mp4?t=1774033205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Monsters Lurking in the Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of monster lurking in the dark chambers deep below the town. You need to learn how to handle each one of them if you want to reach your  ultimate goal, escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/92862df88e414186ae5ffb07ddd5950a.poster.avif?t=1774033205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/92862df88e414186ae5ffb07ddd5950a.webm?t=1774033205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/92862df88e414186ae5ffb07ddd5950a.mp4?t=1774033205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape\u00a0the Catacombs and Save the Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets hiding in\u00a0the catacombs: Who trapped you down here, and why? Who built these halls, and what is the source of the all the other-wordly horrors inhabiting them?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/035a7dd8ee3840e64307e54194ecfc15.poster.avif?t=1774033205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/035a7dd8ee3840e64307e54194ecfc15.webm?t=1774033205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/035a7dd8ee3840e64307e54194ecfc15.mp4?t=1774033205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the Sights and Sounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Portsmoor Abysm has hand-crafted pixels with a 16 bit vibe, coupled with atmospheric sounds\u00a0and music. Explore the stylish catacombs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/d33f57c20ad684b40d47c990d4a11263.poster.avif?t=1774033205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/d33f57c20ad684b40d47c990d4a11263.webm?t=1774033205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/d33f57c20ad684b40d47c990d4a11263.mp4?t=1774033205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Episodes of Mind-Bending Puzzles and Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Portsmoor Abysm consist of four episode, each with 18 levels of increasingly challenging puzzles. Throughout your journey down the Catacombs of Portsmoor is woven a story of ancient mysteries, and trying to get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Trapped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/ba8e208838b546eea0ba4a7df11b06bbd9d09d5d.jpg"},{"name":"Crushed by effigy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/2f9423c61d525dcc8c53e69caa32e849aa655d32.jpg"},{"name":"Abomination exploded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/0f7101abf23674daf16336061d3c596d440c9fb4.jpg"},{"name":" Episode 1 finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/df2366af1c78eda6c34d2bfc44971c959b6d1909.jpg"},{"name":"Episode 2 finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/fa247079589f43d2208b34441c1289eac36457b3.jpg"},{"name":"Episode 3 finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/28dd0bc7ffc6225c6ae6b2d550fab05ba7b41738.jpg"},{"name":"Episode 4 finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/689e740382e41d65ab6446fa14ab5a3b2bd17557.jpg"},{"name":"Squished empty slime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/cde38ec849049bc9fc042bfe5cfb9686d972e26e.jpg"},{"name":"Two from one","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/e6b87623830c85d7d64e7e9c571a0033499999c1.jpg"},{"name":"The Pale Queen killed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025180/b843cf0c94ee653fca0261cb139d411176dde42c.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.aka